1446 0 obj
<</Dest[ 18 0 R /Fit]/Next 1447 0 R /Parent 1434 0 R /Title(Python strings are immutable: once a string object is created, its characters cannot be changed in place. Operations that appear to modify text create and return a new string. For example, text.upper\(\) returns an uppercase copy; it does not overwrite text. To keep the result, assign it: text = text.upper\(\).)>>
endobj
1447 0 obj
<</Dest[ 18 0 R /Fit]/Parent 1434 0 R /Prev 1446 0 R /Title<>>>
endobj
